aje vare, loke vimhayajānake.", "Appamatto mahāvīro, puññaṁ katvābhimodati.", "Tasmiṁ vasseva sāvaṇe, māse navamadivase.", "Sūriyuggamane kāle, nibbattāyaṁ vibhāvanā.", "Yattakaṁ sāsanaṁ ṭhitaṁ, tattakaṁ racitaṁ mayā.", "Ṭhātu nettivibhāvanā, jinaputtahitāvahā.", "Iti taṁ racayantena, puññaṁ adhigataṁ mayā.", "Hontu tassānubhāvena, sabbe vimuttibhāgino.", "Rājadevī puttanattā, panattā ca sajātikā.", "Sabbe rajjasukhe ṭhatvā, carantu caritaṁ sukhī.", "Devo kāle suvassatu, sabbo raṭṭhajano sukhī.", "Aññamaññaṁ ahiṁsanto, piyo hotu hitāvahoti."], "app": []}, {"label": null, "lines": ["Nettivibhāvinī niṭṭhitā."], "app": []}]}